    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Temple lodging 安楽寺宿坊 at Temple 6, with an onsen bath; 57 rooms. From ¥6,000 room only, from ¥8,500 with dinner and breakfast (Oct 2026); vegetarian meals on request. Evening service for guests at 19:00 (or 17:30). Check-in 15:00-20:00, check-out 9:00. Cards accepted; English spoken. Tel: 088-694-2046 https://shikoku6.or.jp/shukubo/</desc>
