--- research (2022): Free / Open-sided shelter with pointed roof on the T18→T19 leg, ~1km before Tatsueji. Listed as nojuku candidate in 2022 survey. No walls - wind/rain exposed. Konbini in Tatsue. Bail-out option.
Source: pilgrim-shikoku.net/tatsueji-19; mititabi.com 2022</desc>
