  <wpt lat="33.944288" lon="134.549144">
    <name>Pilgrimage Lodge Otsuru</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Inn きちん宿 お鶴 in an old Japanese house, about 7 km before Temple 20; open since February 2024. Four rooms, ¥5,500 room only, ¥8,800 with dinner and breakfast (Oct 2026). Check-in 15:00-19:00, check-out 9:00. Cards accepted. Tel: 090-3183-8155 jumbomami1507yo@yahoo.co.jp</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.73029" lon="134.530247">
    <name>Roadside Station Hiwasa</name>
    <type>hut</type>
    <desc>Roadside Station - sleeping tolerated (roadside station etiquette: after close, leave early)
道の駅 日和佐
https://www.henro.org/place/road-station-hiwasa
Features: Running water, Toilet
--- research (2024): Free (unofficial) / Roadside station ~700m from T23 Yakuoji. Free pilgrim footbath, toilets, water. Informal overnight: discreet corner AFTER closing, no open tent, gone early. Not officially permitted - check for signs. Do NOT camp at nearby Ohama beach (loggerhead turtle nesting, light restrictions).
Source: mititabi.com 2022; michinoekihiwasa.com; ohenro.jp etiquette article 2024</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.973568" lon="134.367684">
    <name>Roadside station Onsen-no-sato Kamiyama</name>
    <type>hut</type>
