道の駅 温泉の里神山
https://www.henro.org/place/roadside-station-onsen-no-sato-kamiyama
Features: Running water, Toilet</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.07212" lon="134.50145">
    <name>Route check (T17 to Tokushima)</name>
    <type>waypoint</type>
    <desc>Note on the source map: the henro-michi website and the base map disagree with this line after here. The source map also carries a separate 3.6 km &quot;Henro from T17&quot; line for this stretch.</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.092721" lon="134.307997">
    <name>Ryokan Business Hotel Yawata</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Ryokan and business hotel 手打ちうどん旅館ビジネスホテル八幡, 2 km from Temple 10, with an udon restaurant. 30 rooms, from ¥5,830 room only (Oct 2026). Check-in 16:00-19:00, check-out 10:00. Cash only. Tel: 0883-36-5327 https://www.u-yawata.com/</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.9675" lon="134.346941">
    <name>Ryokan Sakuraya</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Ryokan さくらや旅館 in central Kamiyama beside the Yorii-naka bus stop (buses to Tokushima Station, last 19:15). ¥6,000 room only, ¥8,500 with dinner and breakfast (Oct 2026). Cash only. Tel: 088-676-0036</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.068965" lon="134.478398">
    <name>Ryokan Urokoro</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Ryokan 鱗楼, about 120 years old and known for its dinners, near Temple 16. Five rooms, ¥5,500 room only, ¥9,350 with dinner and breakfast (Oct 2026). Pickups around Temple 13 and nearby. Check-in 15:00. Cards accepted; English spoken. Tel: 088-642-4337 https://urokorou.com/</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.055767" lon="134.353997">
    <name>Ryokan Yoshino</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Ryokan 旅館吉野, 10 minutes from Temple 11 - a last bed before the Shosanji climb. ¥5,500 room only, ¥8,000 with dinner and breakfast (Oct 2026). Breakfast from 6:00, rice balls for the trail, luggage forwarding. Tel: 0883-24-1263</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.015431" lon="134.330376">
    <name>Ryusuian Rest Area</name>
    <type>hut</type>
    <desc>Rest hut at about 500 m on the Temple 11 → 12 climb, with a reliable spring (柳の水) and a toilet. A posted notice allows overnight stays in emergencies only; futon and power outlets inside (2022 report). The source map notes a possible tent spot further on at the Ipponsugi-an mountain hut (34.00759, 134.30514). 柳水庵休憩所 https://www.henro.org/place/ryusuian-rest-area-kamiyama-tokushima</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.072183" lon="134.355807">
    <name>Sakura Ryokan</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Shōwa-era ryokan さくら旅館 in front of JR Kamojima Station, about 2.5 km before Temple 11. Twelve rooms, ¥5,000 room only, ¥7,000 with dinner and breakfast (Oct 2026); rice balls for the next day. Check-in 15:00-19:00. Cash only; English spoken. Bookings by phone. Tel: 0883-24-2404</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.071569" lon="134.550519">
    <name>Seifu Business Hotel</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Budget hotel
ビジネスホテル 清風荘
https://www.henro.org/place/seifu-business-hotel
Features: Bidet, Bike rental, Body wash, Hair dryer, Iron, Kettle, Parking, Postal services, Shampoo, Towels, TV, WIFI, Yukata / bathrobe
Tel: 0886255708</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.069618" lon="134.549469">
    <name>Self-inn Tokushima Higashisenba</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Business hotel セルフイン徳島東船場, 15 minutes&apos; walk from Tokushima Station, close to the route. From ¥4,300 (Oct 2026); breakfast 7:00. Free washer and dryer. Check-in 16:00-21:00, check-out 10:00. Cards accepted. Tel: 088-626-0818</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.078728" lon="134.51889">
    <name>Self-inn Tokushima Kuramoto-ekimae</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Business hotel セルフイン徳島蔵本駅前 in front of JR Kuramoto Station, about 4 km past Temple 17. From ¥4,700 (Oct 2026); breakfast 6:30. Free washer and dryer. Check-in 16:00-21:00, check-out 10:00. Cards accepted. Tel: 088-676-2818</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.06859" lon="134.5467">
    <name>Shinmachi Onsen</name>
    <type>poi</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.9820924" lon="134.3040326">
    <name>Shosanji Okunoin</name>
    <type>mountain</type>
    <desc>Inner shrine of Temple 12 (焼山寺 奥の院 蔵王大権現) beside the summit of Mt Shosanji (938 m). An out-and-back from the temple. Position from OpenStreetMap.</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.073452" lon="134.548674">
    <name>Smile Hotel Tokushima</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Business hotel スマイルホテル徳島 a 5-minute walk from Tokushima Station. From ¥5,500 room only (Oct 2026). Check-in 15:00. Cards accepted. Tel: 088-626-0889 https://smile-hotels.com/hotels/show/tokushima</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.07321" lon="134.55062">
    <name>Spa Bizan no Yu</name>
    <type>poi</type>
    <desc>https://sunroute-tokushima.com/</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.072896" lon="134.550781">
    <name>Subaruyado Yoshino</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Japanese-style inn 阿波の国・昴宿よしの a 3-minute walk from Tokushima Station. No meals. Cards accepted. Tel: 088-654-2255 https://www.subaruyado-yoshino.com/</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.987025" lon="134.326663">
    <name>Sudachi-an</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Pilgrim inn お宿すだち庵 at Nabeiwa, on the route 2.7 km below Temple 12 - the only open lodging between Fujiidera and Kamiyama since the Shosanji shukubo and Nabeiwa-so closed. ¥4,900 room only, ¥5,900 with breakfast, ¥6,900 with dinner, ¥7,900 with both (Oct 2026); cash only. Six rooms, curry dinner, shuttle to the Kamiyama Onsen bath. Bookings by phone in Japanese (Tel: 090-2677-8000), or in English by email to null1903@gmail.com with name, dates, number of people, gender, the previous night&apos;s lodging and whether vegetarian. No fixed check-in time; arrivals before 14:00 phone ahead. Bags are carried free from Ryokan Yoshino, Guest House Channel-kan, Awarakuya and Hostel OE near Temple 11 to Sudachi-an, so the Shosanji climb can be walked light. https://sudachian.com/book/</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.08702" lon="134.314314">
    <name>Sumi Fertilizer Warehouse Pilgrim Hut</name>
    <type>hut</type>
    <desc>Hut - sleepable (unofficial - be discreet, ask if possible)
須見肥料店遍路小屋
https://www.henro.org/place/sumi-fertilizer-warehouse-pilgrim-hut-awa-tokushima
Features: Toilet</desc>
  </wpt>
