    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Chain business hotel スーパーホテル徳島・小松島天然温泉 with a natural hot-spring bath, about 1 km off the route before Temple 18. Check-in 15:00. Cards accepted. Tel: 0885-32-9001 https://www.superhotel.co.jp/s_hotels/komatsushima/</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.152507" lon="134.465059">
    <name>Tabibito-no-yado Michishirube</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Inn 旅人の宿 道しるべ near Temple 3. Dinner and breakfast available. Cash only. Bookings by email at least four days ahead to lamp-an@m5.dion.ne.jp. Tel: 088-672-6171</desc>
  </wpt>
