    <type>campsite</type>
    <desc>Camp spot (Free)
田井ノ浜駅前の東屋
Open pavilion at the seasonal JR Tainohama beach halt, T22→T23 leg. In the current Hagimori List (Feb 2026) as a free option; roof/water/toilet per 2022 survey. Beach toilets. Roof only, no walls.
Source: hagimorilist.com PDF 2026-02-18; mititabi.com 2022 (2026)</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.986874" lon="134.342467">
    <name>Tamagatoge Rest Stop</name>
    <type>water</type>
    <desc>Rest hut on Tamagatoge pass (玉ヶ峠, about 450 m) between Temple 12 and Temple 13. Water tap (working Nov 2025); toilet closed. Signs on the hut forbid camping. https://www.henro.org/place/tamagatao-rest-stop-kamiyama-tokushima</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="33.96814" lon="134.606461">
    <name>Tatsueji Shukubo</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Temple lodging 立江寺宿坊 at Temple 19. ¥5,500 room only, ¥7,000 with dinner and breakfast (Oct 2026). Check-in by 16:30; prayers at 17:00; check-out 8:00. Free washer. Cash only. Tel: 0885-37-1019 https://www.tatsueji.com/stay</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.065002" lon="134.561325">
    <name>Tokushima Grandvrio Hotel</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Hotel 徳島グランヴィリオホテル in Tokushima city. Check-in 15:00, check-out 11:00. English spoken. Tel: 088-624-1111 https://www.grandvrio-hotelresort.com/tokushima/</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.06696" lon="134.547138">
    <name>Tokushima Washington Hotel Plaza</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Hotel 徳島ワシントンホテルプラザ in central Tokushima. Check-in 14:00, check-out 10:00. Cards accepted. Tel: 088-653-7111 https://www.washingtonhotel.co.jp/whp/tokushima/</desc>
  </wpt>
