    <name>Uemura Ryokan</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Ryokan 植村旅館 on the route 9.6 km past Temple 12, 11.9 km before Temple 13. From ¥5,300 room only, from ¥8,800 with dinner and breakfast (Oct 2026). Large home-cooked meals; arrival by 18:00. Pickups and luggage transfer by arrangement. Tel: 088-678-0859 https://r.goope.jp/uemura-inn</desc>
